   U.S. inflation-adjustment clause is removed.
2. A "Noncommercial and Personal Use" section is added, so that
   noncommercial use and use by individuals for personal, community,
   educational, and research purposes is a permitted purpose.
3. A "Commercial License" section is added: use for the benefit of a
   company that does not meet the Small Business conditions — in
